    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d361">

                <pb facs="0373" n="367" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg367"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Curry to Mr.
                            Bayard</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1886-11-30"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 30,
                        1886</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>This Government offers $1,500,000 in full settlement of the claim of Mora. Will
                    be charged on Cuban budget of next year. Shall I accept with authority to
                    arrange details of payment?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Curry.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
